{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785133911888,"sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"glob","callID":"call_QhZxK2hs31CTcLf5tmj1tDTv","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":".opencode/skills/**/{mcp_server,mcp-server}/package.json"},"output":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/mcp-code-mode/mcp-server/package.json\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/mcp-server/package.json\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/mcp-server/package.json","metadata":{"count":3,"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1785133911525,"end":1785133911885}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08386469f3ac3b14016a66fb57575c8191bb112ef1c088ed69"}},"id":"prt_fa245cdde001GcJaoLVL0I3R6f","sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","messageID":"msg_fa24583d3001m3IH87k1UPOQ0H"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785133911898,"sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_UjKLxfGSMLoA9baqINAaO4lz","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n --glob '!**/.opencode/specs/**' --glob '*.{ts,js,cjs,mjs,md,yaml,yml,json}' 'metrics-stub|assert-never|shared-payload|query-result-adapter|compact-merger|ops-hardening' .","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public","timeout":120000},"output":"./README.md:603:**Startup injection.** When the MCP server starts, it initializes the `code-graph.sqlite` database, runs a non-blocking startup scan and activates a file watcher. Claude Code transports the compact startup shared-payload through its runtime hook (`session-prime.ts`). OpenCode uses plugin surfaces for in-session context and routing. The payload includes a one-line health summary, `graphQualitySummary` (detector provenance + edge-enrichment summary) and the `sharedPayloadTransport` envelope. `session_bootstrap()` remains available as a manual recovery surface when native hooks are disabled.\n./.opencode/specs/descriptions.json:12773:      \"specFolder\": \"system-code-graph/z_archive/017-opencode-graph-plugin/001-shared-payload-provenance-layer\",\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/references/config/hook-system.md:133:All four supported runtimes transport the same compact startup shared-payload through their runtime-specific hooks. The payload is produced by `buildStartupBrief()`, which is defined locally in each runtime's session-prime hook and delegates to `getStartupBriefFromMarker()` in `mcp-server/lib/code-graph-boundary.ts`; it includes `graphQualitySummary` (detector provenance + edge-enrichment summary) alongside the `sharedPayloadTransport` envelope. Runtime-specific startup entrypoints:\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/compact-merger.ts:208:        sourceRefs: ['budget-allocator', 'compact-merger'],\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/index.ts:99:} from './compact-merger.js';\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/package.json:9:    \"./compact-merger\": \"./dist/compact-merger.js\",\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/README.md:126:# budget-allocator.ts, compact-merger.ts, code-graph-contracts.ts\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/README.md:164:├── compact-merger.ts           # Compacted context merge helpers\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/README.md:232:| `compact-merger.ts` | Compacted context merge helpers |\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/discovery/session-bootstrap-reader-ready-context.md:45:| `mcp-server/lib/context/shared-payload.ts` | Library | Produces the bounded workspace profile used by the handler |\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md:3:description: \"session_health reports shared-payload status, freshness, and degraded-state recovery hints so operators can verify the startup channel without a full bootstrap call.\"\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md:44:| `mcp-server/lib/context/shared-payload.ts` | Library | Exposes producer state and last-publish timestamps |\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md:57:- Feature file path: `discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md`\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/discovery/session-resume-continuity-ladder.md:60:- [session-health-shared-payload.md](../../feature-catalog/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md) — Session health shared payload\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/context-preservation/working-set-tracker.md:54:- [compact-merger.md](../../feature-catalog/context-preservation/compact-merger.md) — Compact merger\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/context-preservation/session-start-priming.md:17:> **Scope note:** This page documents the Claude-specific SessionStart priming path. All three supported runtimes (Claude, Copilot, OpenCode) now transport the same compact startup shared-payload (including `graphQualitySummary`) through their runtime-specific hooks — see `../ux-hooks/21-shared-provenance-and-copilot-compact-cache-parity.md` and `references/config/hook-system.md` (Shared Startup Payload Parity section) for the cross-runtime matrix.\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/context-preservation/query-intent-classifier.md:47:- [compact-merger.md](../../feature-catalog/context-preservation/compact-merger.md) — Compact merger\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/context-preservation/compact-merger.md:6:  - \"compact-merger\"\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/context-preservation/compact-merger.md:27:.opencode/skills/system-code-graph/mcp-server/lib/compact-merger.ts\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/context-preservation/compact-merger.md:51:- Feature file path: `context-preservation/compact-merger.md`\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:3805:| 258 | Context Preservation | 3-source compact merger within budget | [258](../manual-testing-playbook/context-preservation/compact-merger-assembly.md) | [context-preservation/compact-merger.md](../feature-catalog/context-preservation/compact-merger.md) |\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md:6:id: discovery-session-health-shared-payload\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md:48:2. Inspect shared-payload producer state and freshness fields.\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/discovery/session-health-shared-payload.md:65:- `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/mcp-server/lib/context/shared-payload.ts`\n./.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/context-preservation/compact-merger-assembly.md:6:id: context-pre