hase.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-62-- **Fail**: Any phase is absent, out of order, skipped, or replaced with an unrelated process label.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-63-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-64-### Failure Triage\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-65-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-66-1. Confirm the operator request did not use `$short` or `$raw`, which intentionally changes phase behavior.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-67-2. Inspect `references/depth-framework.md` Phase Exit Criteria for the canonical order.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md:68:3. Re-run through `@prompt-improver` with `constraints=\\\"include explicit phase log\\\"` and compare ordering.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-69-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-70-### Optional Supplemental Checks\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-71-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-72-Check that CLEAR scoring appears only after the Test phase, not before Prototype completes.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-73-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-74----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-75-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-76-## 4. SOURCE FILES\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-77-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-78-### Playbook Sources\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-79-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-80-| File | Role |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-81-|---|---|\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-82-| `manual-testing-playbook.md` | Root directory page and scenario summary |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md:83:| `../../SKILL.md` | sk-prompt skill source: §3 enhancement pipeline, §7 `@prompt-improver` contract |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-84-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-85-### Implementation And Test Anchors\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-86-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-87-| File | Role |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-88-|---|---|\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-89-| `../../references/depth-framework.md` | DEPTH phase definitions and mandatory exit criteria |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-90-| `../../references/patterns-evaluation.md` | CLEAR scoring reference used at Test phase |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-91-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-7-# SP-014 -- Phase exit gates block advancement\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-8-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-9-This document captures the realistic user-testing contract, current behavior, execution flow, source anchors, and metadata for `SP-014`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-10-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-11----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-12-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-13-## 1. OVERVIEW\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-14-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:15:This scenario validates that every DEPTH phase has named exit criteria and that failed criteria block advancement. The operator improves a SQL-query prompt and asks `@prompt-improver` to show each gate as it runs.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-16-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-17-### Why This Matters\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-18-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-19-Without exit gates, DEPTH becomes a narration layer instead of an enforcement mechanism. Blocking criteria make quality failures visible before delivery.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-20-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-21----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-22-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-23-## 2. SCENARIO CONTRACT\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-24-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-25-Operators run the exact prompt and command sequence for `SP-014` and confirm the expected signals without contradictory evidence.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-26-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-27-- Objective: Confirm every DEPTH phase has named exit criteria and cannot advance until its gate passes or re-runs.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-28-- Real user request: `I want to see the DEPTH process show me each phase's exit criteria as it runs — make my SQL query prompt better.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-29-- Prompt: `Improve my SQL query prompt; verify every DEPTH phase reports exit criteria and failed gates block or rerun before advancing.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:30:- Expected execution process: `@prompt-improver` logs each phase, its criterion, status, and any re-run reason before moving on.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-31-- Expected signals: Five gate rows; statuses are `passed`, `re-ran`, or `blocked`; no phase starts after a failed predecessor without remediation.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-32-- Desired user-visible outcome: Gate-status table followed by the enhanced SQL prompt.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-33-- Pass/fail: PASS if all five named gates appear and failures are remediated; FAIL if gates are missing, unnamed, or ignored.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-34-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-35----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-36-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-37-## 3. TEST EXECUTION\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-38-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-40-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-41-```\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-42-Improve my SQL query prompt; verify every DEPTH phase reports exit criteria and failed gates block or rerun before advancing.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-43-```\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-44-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-45-### Commands\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-46-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-47-1. `sk-prompt: I want to see the DEPTH process show me each phase's exit criteria as it runs — make my SQL query prompt better.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:48:2. `agent: @prompt-improver raw_task=\\\"Improve a SQL query prompt and report every DEPTH phase exit gate.\\\" task_type=generation target_cli=opencode complexity_hint=7 constraints=\\\"Include gate name, status, and remediation for each phase.\\\"`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-49-3. `bash: rg 'Phase Exit Criteria|Exit:' .opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/references/depth-framework.md`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-50-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-51-### Expected\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-52-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-53-The report includes five phase gates and shows that advancement only occurs after `passed` or `re-ran then passed`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-54-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-55-### Evidence\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-56-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-60-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-61-- **Pass**: All five phases have named exit criteria and no failed gate is silently bypassed.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-62-- **Fail**: A phase has no criterion, status is missing, or a failed criterion does not block/re-run before advancement.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-63-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-64-### Failure Triage\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-65-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-66-1. Inspect `depth-framework.md` Phase Exit Criteria for the canonical gate names.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-67-2. Compare the returned phase table against the D-E-P-T-H order.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:68:3. Re-dispatch to `@prompt-improver` with `constraints=\\\"print gate table before final prompt\\\"`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-69-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-70-### Optional Supplemental Checks\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-71-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-72-Inject a deliberately weak SQL prompt and verify the Test gate re-runs on low CLEAR score.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-73-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-74----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-75-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-76-## 4. SOURCE FILES\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-77-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-78-### Playbook Sources\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-79-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-80-| File | Role |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-81-|---|---|\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-82-| `manual-testing-playbook.md` | Root directory page and scenario summary |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:83:| `../../SKILL.md` | sk-prompt skill source: §3 enhancement pipeline and §7 `@prompt-improver` contract |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-84-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-85-### Implementation And Test Anchors\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-86-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-87-| File | Role |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-88-|---|---|\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-89-| `../../references/depth-framework.md` | Mandatory DEPTH phase exit criteria |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-90-| `../../references/patterns-evaluation.md` | CLEAR criteria used by the Test gate |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-91-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-7-# SP-012 -- RICCE validation gate\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-8-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-9-This document captures the realistic user-testing contract, current behavior, execution flow, source anchors, and metadata for `SP-012`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-10-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-11----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-12-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-13-## 1. OVERVIEW\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-14-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md:15:This scenario validates that the final prompt passes the RICCE gate before delivery. The operator asks for a new-engineer onboarding prompt and verifies that `@prompt-improver` includes or justifies Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, and Examples.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-16-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-17-### Why This Matters\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-18-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-19-RICCE omissions create prompts that look polished but fail in handoff. The gate makes missing structure visible and recoverable.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-20-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-21----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-22-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-23-## 2. SCENARIO CONTRACT\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-24-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-25-Operators run the exact prompt and command sequence for `SP-012` and confirm the expected signals without contradictory evidence.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-26-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-27-- Objective: Confirm all RICCE elements are present or explicitly justified before delivery.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-28-- Real user request: `Make my onboarding prompt for new engineers more rigorous — I want explicit role, instructions, context, constraints, and examples.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-29-- Prompt: `Strengthen my new-engineer onboarding prompt; verify the final output accounts for Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, and Examples.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md:30:- Expected execution process: `@prompt-improver` runs DEPTH, validates RICCE in Prototype/Harmonize, and blocks silent omissions.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-31-- Expected signals: Five RICCE rows; each row is `present` or `omitted with reason`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-32-- Desired user-visible outcome: Enhanced onboarding prompt plus `RICCE: Role=present, Instructions=present, Context=present, Constraints=present, Examples=present`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-33-- Pass/fail: PASS if all 5 RICCE elements are present or justified; FAIL if any element is missing without explanation.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-34-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-35----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-36-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-37-## 3. TEST EXECUTION\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-38-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-40-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-41-```\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-42-Strengthen my new-engineer onboarding prompt; verify the final output accounts for Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, and Examples.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-43-```\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-44-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-45-### Commands\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-46-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-47-1. `sk-prompt: Make my onboarding prompt for new engineers more rigorous — I want explicit role, instructions, context, constraints, and examples.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md:48:2. `agent: @prompt-improver raw_task=\\\"Improve an onboarding prompt for new engineers with explicit RICCE coverage.\\\" task_type=generation target_cli=opencode complexity_hint=7 constraints=\\\"Return Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, Examples status.\\\"`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-49-3. `bash: rg 'RICCE|Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, Examples|present or justified' .opencode/skills/sk-prompt/SKILL.md .opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/references/depth-framework.md`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-50-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-51-### Expected\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-52-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-53-The final response includes an enhanced onboarding prompt and a RICCE status table with all 5 elements accounted for.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-54-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-55-### Evidence\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-56-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-60-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-61-- **Pass**: Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, and Examples are each marked present or omitted with a concrete reason.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-62-- **Fail**: Any RICCE element is absent from both the prompt and the status table.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-63-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-64-### Failure Triage\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-65-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-66-1. Inspect SKILL.md §4 for the RICCE validation rule.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-67-2. Inspect `depth-framework.md` Prototype and Harmonize gates for where the check should run.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md:68:3. Re-dispatch to `@prompt-improver` with `constraints=\\\"block delivery on missing RICCE status\\\"`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-69-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-70-### Optional Supplemental Checks\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-71-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-72-Verify examples are meaningful examples, not placeholder labels with no sample content.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-73-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-74----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/