`Converted from: .opencode/agents/...`.\n  - CAT-3/CAT-4 candidates: committed hidden scan scripts/results under `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/`, including absolute developer paths in `.scan-one.sh:5-6` and `.scan-validate-all.py:7-8`.\n  - CAT-3 candidates outside excluded specs:\n    - `.opencode/opencode-rag.log`\n    - `.opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/.opencode/logs/cli-dispatch-audit.log`\n    - `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/mcp-server/database/.mk-spec-memory-launcher.log`\n  - Root `.mcp.json` and `.cursor/mcp.json` are symlinks to `.claude/mcp.json`; `.claude/.utcp_config.json` is a symlink to `../.utcp_config.json`, so these are ruled out as duplicate residue.\n  - `.rename-engine-disposable` is referenced by rename-engine safety code and should be ruled out as accidental residue.\n  - No misplaced nested `graph-metadata.json` or `description.json` was found; metadata pairs occur at hub roots.\n- Exact proof command pattern used repeatedly:\n  - `rg -n --glob '!**/.opencode/specs/**' --glob '*.{ts,js,cjs,mjs,md,yaml,yml,json,sh,py,toml}' '<literal-pattern>' .`\n- Confirmed committed hidden scan artifacts with:\n  - `git ls-files -- \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-one.sh\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-one-fast.sh\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-validate-all.sh\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-validate-all.py\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-validate-all.txt\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-results.txt\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.scan-lines.txt\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.folder-list.txt\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.unscanned.txt\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.no-frontmatter-list.txt\" \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/.enumerate-no-frontmatter.py\"`\n\n### Active\n- Evidence collection is substantially complete through iteration-angle