'compiled-routing');\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/README.md:\n  Line 14: `bin/lib/` holds two unrelated groups. The first is the shared CommonJS helpers that the MCP launchers in `bin/` require: it supervises the lifetime of the hf-model-server, bridges launcher stdio to a running daemon socket, reconnects that bridge transparently across daemon recycles, and constrains the environment passed to the embedding sidecar. The second is the compiled-routing serving surface: the activation-manifest library, the runtime-generation selector, and the generated closure the routing hot path loads.\n\n  Line 59: - `compiled-routing/` is **generated output**, not source. `compiled-route-sync.cjs` traces the runtime closure from an authored resolver, stages a candidate, verifies every hub against it, and renames it over this directory. Anything written here by hand is erased by the next publication and cannot be promoted back, because only files the trace touches are copied. Change the authored program directory under `.opencode/specs/` instead, then republish. The directory carries no README for the same reason.\n\n  Line 73: +-- compiled-routing/              # GENERATED serving closure, promoted by compiled-route-sync.cjs\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/compiled-routing/014-runtime-engine/lib/compiled-route.cjs:\n  Line 21: // Each hub's compiled policy + engine live in its shadow rollout child; this\n\n  Line 31:   'sk-code': '009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code',\n\n  Line 32:   'system-deep-loop': '009-parent-hub-rollout/002-system-deep-loop',\n\n  Line 33:   'mcp-tooling': '009-parent-hub-rollout/003-mcp-tooling',\n\n  Line 34:   'cli-external-orchestration': '009-parent-hub-rollout/004-cli-external-orchestration',\n\n  Line 35:   'sk-prompt': '009-parent-hub-rollout/005-sk-prompt',\n\n  Line 36:   'sk-design': '009-parent-hub-rollout/006-sk-design',\n\n  Line 37:   'sk-doc': '009-parent-hub-rollout/007-sk-doc',\n\n  Line 96: function compiledRoute(hubId, taskText) {\n\n  Line 110: module.exports = { compiledRoute, loadHubEngine, HUB_CHILD };\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/compiled-routing/014-runtime-engine/lib/resolve.cjs:\n  Line 12: //      the manifest's selected policy — a drifted rollout artifact fails safe.\n\n  Line 20: const { compiledRoute } = require('./compiled-route.cjs');\n\n  Line 48:     process.stderr.write(`[compiled-routing] ${message}\\n`);\n\n  Line 108:     const route = compiledRoute(hubId, taskText);\n\n  Line 110:     // exact generation the manifest selected. If a rollout artifact drifted after\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/compiled-route-guard.cjs:\n  Line 4: // Catches the one compiled-routing failure that actually recurs: a hub's routing\n\n  Line 38: const RUNTIME_ROOT = path.join(REPO_ROOT, '.opencode', 'bin', 'lib', 'compiled-routing');\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/compiled-routing/serving-closure.manifest.json:\n  Line 4:   \"runtimeRoot\": \".opencode/bin/lib/compiled-routing\",\n\n  Line 27:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json\",\n\n  Line 28:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code/harness/build-artifacts.cjs\",\n\n  Line 29:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code/lib/canary-router.cjs\",\n\n  Line 30:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code/lib/policy-card.cjs\",\n\n  Line 31:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/001-sk-code/lib/registry-compiler.cjs\",\n\n  Line 32:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/002-system-deep-loop/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json\",\n\n  Line 33:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/002-system-deep-loop/harness/build-artifacts.cjs\",\n\n  Line 34:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/002-system-deep-loop/lib/canary-router.cjs\",\n\n  Line 35:     \"009-parent-hub-rollout/002-system-