/system-skill-advisor/mcp-server/skill-advisor-cli.ts:\n  Line 180:     const launcherPath = path.join(directOpencodeDir, 'bin', 'mk-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs');\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/system-skill-advisor/z_archive/008-skill-advisor-documentation/004-documentation-quality-refactor/001-documentation-quality-audit-research/research/iterations/iteration-004.md:\n  Line 12: - Launcher command: `node .opencode/bin/mk-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs` <ref_file file=\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/INSTALL_GUIDE.md\" line=\"67\" />\n\n  Line 39: - Launcher script exists: `/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/mk-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs` <ref_file file=\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/mk-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs\" />\n\n\n(Results truncated. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)","metadata":{"matches":100,"truncated":true},"title":"mk-spec-memory-launcher|mk-skill-advisor-launcher|mk-code-index-launcher","time":{"start":1785134512302,"end":1785134512337}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03fe8c3abcaf7ab2016a66fdb024848191afd246f48f16c447"}},"id":"prt_fa24ef8a3001gQzhDlfIi9jLQD","sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","messageID":"msg_fa24ec9dc001aS6yDJgiu1b8D3"}}
