{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785134639980,"sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_VPAHIKmJYnd5qjiobnf1uQp6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"deep-research-resume-adapter","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml","include":"*.yaml"},"output":"No files found","metadata":{"matches":0,"truncated":false},"title":"deep-research-resume-adapter","time":{"start":1785134639968,"end":1785134639978}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08b5431fb491411e016a66fe2fbbb88191bf6cc241d6bcb66a"}},"id":"prt_fa250eb52001ErXvXGuGt8XEOK","sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","messageID":"msg_fa2507600001X1rhQDYPE1nFn0"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785134640023,"sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_hbsYi5cb3WhMRWOfMX0NjGOK","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"deep-research-resume-adapter","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml","include":"*.yaml"},"output":"No files found","metadata":{"matches":0,"truncated":false},"title":"deep-research-resume-adapter","time":{"start":1785134639990,"end":1785134640017}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08b5431fb491411e016a66fe2fbbc48191896e062511dbcb2c"}},"id":"prt_fa250eb63001ecv4vqcVSrBiCS","sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","messageID":"msg_fa2507600001X1rhQDYPE1nFn0"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785134640023,"sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_hi7UCTx0qgljVU81WX5G2au8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/README.md","offset":52,"limit":28},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n52: \n53: ---\n54: \n55: ### Compiled routing\n56: \n57: - `compiled-route-manifest.cjs` is the activation-manifest library. It mints and refreshes a hub's manifest, answers whether that manifest still matches what the hub's routing inputs compile to, and holds a writer lease so a manifest write cannot race a runtime publication. The 89-line `bin/compiled-route-manifest.cjs` is a CLI over this module, not a second copy of it.\n58: - `compiled-route-layout.cjs` resolves which internal generation a runtime root serves. It accepts one complete generation and refuses a root that mixes two, so a probe never reads one generation's activation state through another generation's resolver.\n59: - `compiled-routing/` is **generated output**, not source. `compiled-route-sync.cjs` traces the runtime closure from an authored resolver, stages a candidate, verifies every hub against it, and renames it over this directory. Anything written here by hand is erased by the next publication and cannot be promoted back, because only files the trace touches are copied. Change the authored program directory under `.opencode/specs/` instead, then republish. The directory carries no README for the same reason.\n60: \n61: ---\n62: \n63: ## 3. DIRECTORY TREE\n64: \n65: ```text\n66: lib/\n67: +-- model-server-supervision.cjs   # hf-model-server lifecycle: spawn, watchdog, respawn, reap\n68: +-- launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs        # Socket path resolution, health probes, lease-probe retry, stdio bridging\n69: +-- launcher-session-proxy.cjs     # Reconnecting stdio-to-daemon proxy: replay + createClassifyFrame factory\n70: +-- sidecar-env-allowlist.cjs      # Frozen env-key allowlist for the embedding sidecar\n71: +-- compiled-route-manifest.cjs    # Activation-manifest library: mint, refresh, freshness, writer lease\n72: +-- compiled-route-layout.cjs      # Selects one coherent runtime generation, refuses a mixed root\n73: +-- compiled-routing/              # GENERATED serving closure, promoted by compiled-route-sync.cjs\n74: `-- README.md\n75: ```\n76: \n77: ---\n78: \n79: ## 4. KEY FILES\n\n(Showing lines 52-79 of 167. Use offset=80 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"\n---\n\n### Compiled routing\n\n- `compiled-route-manifest.cjs` is the activation-manifest library. It mints and refreshes a hub's manifest, answers whether that manifest still matches what the hub's routing inputs compile to, and holds a writer lease so a manifest write cannot race a runtime publication. The 89-line `bin/compiled-route-manifest.cjs` is a CLI over this module, not a second copy of it.\n- `compiled-route-layout.cjs` resolves which internal generation a runtime root serves. It accepts one complete generation and refuses a root that mixes two, so a probe never reads one generation's activation state through another generation's resolver.\n- `compiled-routing/` is **generated output**, not source. `compiled-route-sync.cjs` traces the runtime closure from an authored resolver, stages a candidate, verifies every hub against it, and renames it over this directory. Anything written here by hand is erased by the next publication and cannot be promoted back, because only files the trace touches are copied. Change the authored program directory under `.opencode/specs/` instead, then republish. The directory carries no README for the same reason.\n\n---\n\n## 3. DIRECTORY TREE\n\n```text\nlib/\n+-- model-server-supervision.cjs   # hf-model-server lifecycle: spawn, watchdog, respawn, reap\n+-- launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs        # Socket path resolution, health probes, lease-probe retry, stdio bridging\n+-- launcher-session-proxy.cjs     # Reconnecting stdio-to-daemon proxy: replay + createClassifyFrame factory\n+-- sidecar-env-allowlist.cjs      # Frozen env-key allowlist for the embedding sidecar\n+-- compiled-route-manifest.cjs    # Activation-manifest library: mint, refresh, freshness, writer lease","truncated":true,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/bin/lib/README.md","text":"\n---\n\n### Compiled routing\n\n- `compiled-route-manifest.cjs` is the activation-manifest library. It mints and refreshes a hub's manifest, answers whether that manifest still matches what the hub's routing inputs compile to, and holds a writer lease so a manifest write cannot race a runtime publication. The 89-line `bin/compiled-route-manifest.cjs` is a CLI over this module, not a second copy of it.\n- `compiled-route-layout.cjs` resolves which internal generation a runtime root serves. It accepts one complete generation and refuses a root that mixes two, so a probe never reads one generation's activation state through another generation's resolver.\n- `compiled-routing/` is **generated output**, not source. `compiled-route-sync.cjs` traces the runtime closure from an authored resolver, stages a candidate, verifies every hub against it, and renames it over this directory. Anything written here by hand is erased by the next publication and cannot be promoted back, because only files the trace touches are copied. Change the authored program directory under `.opencode/specs/` instead, then republish. The directory carries no README for the same reason.\n\n---\n\n## 3. DIRECTORY TREE\n\n```text\nlib/\n+-- model-server-supervision.cjs   # hf-model-server lifecycle: spawn, watchdog, respawn, reap\n+-- launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs        # Socket path resolution, health probes, lease-probe retry, stdio bridging\n+-- launcher-session-proxy.cjs     # Reconnecting stdio-to-daemon proxy: replay + createClassifyFrame factory\n+-- sidecar-env-allowlist.cjs      # Frozen env-key allowlist for the embedding sidecar\n+-- compiled-route-manifest.cjs    # Activation-manifest library: mint, refresh, freshness, writer lease\n+-- compiled-route-layout.cjs      # Selects one coherent runtime generation, refuses a mixed root\n+-- compiled-routing/              # GENERATED serving closure, promoted by compiled-route-sync.cjs\n`-- README.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. KEY FILES","lineStart":52,"lineEnd":79,"totalLines":167,"truncated":true}},"title":".opencode/bin/lib/README.md","time":{"start":1785134640004,"end":1785134640021}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08b5431fb491411e016a66fe2fbbd88191942e37bd1d4c006e"}},"id":"prt_fa250eb80001UeDjlYNstVC78Q","sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","messageID":"msg_fa2507600001X1rhQDYPE1nFn0"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785134640030,"sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_rZyRHY0ReynDa9l0EufrfGoM","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-shadow-parity/harness-adapter.ts","offset":45,"limit":30},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-shadow-parity/harness-adapter.ts</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n45:   ReplayComponentRegistry,\n46:   createReplayFingerprintVersionRegistry,\n47:   deriveReplayFingerprint,\n48:   prepareReplayFingerprintAttestation,\n49:   recordReplayFingerprintAttestation,\n50:   replayFingerprintAttestationEventDefinition,\n51: } from '../replay-fingerprint/index.js';\n52: import { SEALED_ARTIFACT_REPLAY_INPUT_KEY } from '../sealed-reference-artifacts/index.js';\n53: import {\n54:   compileParityCaseManifest,\n55:   issueParityCertificate,\n56:   runShadowParityCase,\n57:   verifyParityCertificate,\n58: } from '../shadow-parity/index.js';\n59: \n60: import type {\n61:   DeepResearchResumeDecision,\n62:   DeepResearchResumeRequest,\n63: } from '../deep-research-resume-adapter/index.js';\n64: import type {\n65:   AuthoritySnapshot,\n66:   GatewayAllowProof,\n67:   LedgerHead,\n68:   PolicyEvaluationInput,\n69:   PolicyEvaluationResult,\n70:   VerifiedLedgerEvent,\n71: } from '../authorized-ledger/index.js';\n72: import type {\n73:   DeepResearchEventEnvelope,\n74:   DeepResearchEventStem,\n\n(Showing lines 45-74 of 3426. Use offset=75 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"  ReplayComponentRegistry,\n  createReplayFingerprintVersionRegistry,\n  deriveReplayFingerprint,\n  prepareReplayFingerprintAttestation,\n  recordReplayFingerprintAttestation,\n  replayFingerprintAttestationEventDefinition,\n} from '../replay-fingerprint/index.js';\nimport { SEALED_ARTIFACT_REPLAY_INPUT_KEY } from '../sealed-reference-artifacts/index.js';\nimport {\n  compileParityCaseManifest,\n  issueParityCertificate,\n  runShadowParityCase,\n  verifyParityCertificate,\n} from '../shadow-parity/index.js';\n\nimport type {\n  DeepResearchResumeDecision,\n  DeepResearchResumeRequest,\n} from '../deep-research-resume-adapter/index.js';\nimport type {","truncated":true,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-shadow-parity/harness-adapter.ts","text":"  ReplayComponentRegistry,\n  createReplayFingerprintVersionRegistry,\n  deriveReplayFingerprint,\n  prepareReplayFingerprintAttestation,\n  recordReplayFingerprintAttestation,\n  replayFingerprintAttestationEventDefinition,\n} from '../replay-fingerprint/index.js';\nimport { SEALED_ARTIFACT_REPLAY_INPUT_KEY } from '../sealed-reference-artifacts/index.js';\nimport {\n  compileParityCaseManifest,\n  issueParityCertificate,\n  runShadowParityCase,\n  verifyParityCertificate,\n} from '../shadow-parity/index.js';\n\nimport type {\n  DeepResearchResumeDecision,\n  DeepResearchResumeRequest,\n} from '../deep-research-resume-adapter/index.js';\nimport type {\n  AuthoritySnapshot,\n  GatewayAllowProof,\n  LedgerHead,\n  PolicyEvaluationInput,\n  PolicyEvaluationResult,\n  VerifiedLedgerEvent,\n} from '../authorized-ledger/index.js';\nimport type {\n  DeepResearchEventEnvelope,\n  DeepResearchEventStem,","lineStart":45,"lineEnd":74,"totalLines":3426,"truncated":true}},"title":".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-shadow-parity/harness-adapter.ts","time":{"start":1785134639998,"end":1785134640029}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08b5431fb491411e016a66fe2fbbcc8191a4534993285d5a66"}},"id":"prt_fa250eb78001mV9PeezOV39XG1","sessionID":"ses_05dbebdb4ffe8dApbcbo3OIc7y","messageID":"msg_fa2507600001X1rhQDYPE1nFn0"}}
