.\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Delete legacy command bodies\",\"reason\":\"The renderer uses them in both fallback and fix injection modes.\"}],\"directMode\":true,\"executor\":{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"model\":\"openai/gpt-5.6-sol\",\"reasoningEffort\":null,\"serviceTier\":null}}\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-001.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-002.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-003.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-004.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-005.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/prompts/iteration-001.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/prompts/iteration-002.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/prompts/iteration-003.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/prompts/iteration-004.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-archite