route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.12,\"status\":\"thought\",\"focus\":\"Falsify, deduplicate, and severity-rank remaining findings before synthesis.\",\"findingsCount\":0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Low novelty by design: retained nine consolidated defect or simplification clusters and ruled out CAT-1/CAT-2 deletion claims.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which high-value simplifications survive adversarial verification?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Split database state, mirror inventory drift, launcher asymmetry, contract duplication, shadow complexity, routing specialization, command duality, scan portability, and log ignore leakage remain.\"],\"ruledOut\":[{\"approach\":\"Claim confirmed deletable dead code\",\"reason\":\"All named candidates have live, test, CI, manual, or dynamic consumers.\"},{\"approach\":\"Treat intentional compatibility as residue\",\"reason\":\"Fallback and mirror contracts remain active.\"}],\"directMode\":true,\"executor\":{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"model\":\"openai/gpt-5.6-sol\",\"reasoningEffort\":null,\"serviceTier\":null}}\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-006.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-007.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-008.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-009.md\nA .opencode/specs/system-speckit/028-memory-search-intelligence/001-release-cleanup/016-dead-code-and-architecture-audit/research/